sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth

  U->>UI: Click "Sign in with Google"
  activate UI
  UI->>Auth: Initiate Google OAuth
  activate Auth
  Auth-->>U: Redirect to Google consent
  deactivate Auth
  U->>Auth: Authorize
  activate Auth
  Auth->>Auth: Read role from auth.users.app_metadata.role
  Auth-->>UI: Return JWT session
  deactivate Auth
  UI->>Auth: Persist session
  activate Auth
  Auth-->>UI: Session
  deactivate Auth

  alt role == lecturer / admin / student
    UI-->>U: Redirect to role-based dashboard
  else no role
    UI-->>U: Show error: unauthorized account
  end
  deactivate UI
